-- V2_2 — Seed data: German vocabulary bank part 2/3 (A1–C2).
-- ============================================================================
-- V2 — Seed data: German vocabulary bank (A1–C2).
-- Columns: word (German word WITH article for nouns, e.g. 'der Apfel'),
-- ipa (simplified German IPA), part_of_speech (German term: Substantiv /
-- Verb / Adjektiv / ...), meaning_vi (Vietnamese meaning), definition_en
-- (German definition; principal parts for strong verbs), example_en (German
-- example sentence), example_vi (Vietnamese translation), topic,
-- level (A1/A2/B1/B2/C1/C2), article (der|die|das, nouns only),
-- plural (plural form, nouns only).
-- NOTE: example_en / definition_en keep V1 column names for technical
-- compatibility but store German content (see V5__german_columns.sql).
-- ============================================================================

